{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Make the step-body canary replay-visible**\n\nThe step inherits the replaying context's logger, so this INFO call is suppressed. If a regression executes `unexpected_step` before rejecting the identity mismatch, the canary remains absent and requirement 11-1 cannot detect that forbidden execution. Cast `step_context.logger` to the concrete `Logger` and emit through `with_is_replaying(lambda: False)` so the step metadata is preserved while the canary remains visible.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7qIj5v","finding_digest":"82bcda4537c37c562b6d8c5a2bdd00043e92577b9a4a2588bc5c37d289ef6fd6","finding_id":"arf_v1_qk6nurjxyn6fmk3nrrncxxiaaq","finding_key":"conformance/replay_operation_identity.py::unexpected_step::replay-visible-body-canary","identity_key":"conformance/replay_operation_identity.py::unexpected_step::replay-visible-body-canary","line":16,"observation_digest":"3d474b3f1c49698dc6260cfc4e677fc301ffc6601da55993866e91695f8826d4","observation_id":"aro_v1_hvduwpy4jfuy3rrgbt6e4z37ym","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-conformance-tests/handlers/general/replay_operation_identity.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_qk6nurjxyn6fmk3nrrncxxiaaq","published_at":"2026-09-03T19:46:41Z","review_id":"arr_v1_wzrc7vfnk7tshp7svrc2nd7e74","reviewed_base_sha":"b326ac8676eee8965145cda9759c4ccd6d7f7790","reviewed_head_sha":"529310cf7ba0d3aa69b81adef13730ebb14ad047","reviewer":"codex","start_line":16,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":701},"record_id":"art_v1_25m3fnesmploxnwbsu6xeq5l6l","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-03T19:46:41Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
